finition", "content": "a wide open view from a high place "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We can see a vista of the ocean from up here."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "typical "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "usual; expected "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Typical young women love to go shopping."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "seasonal "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "for a certain season of the year "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Bring seasonal clothing on the fall trip."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "venture "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a trip to a new place "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We need a guide on the venture up to the volcano."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob10aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gear "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "special clothing or equipment for a sport or trip "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When we climb, we use our mountain gear."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob10aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "astonishing"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "amazing; incredible "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The rocks in the canyon are astonishing."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob10aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "priority "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "more  important than other things "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Safety in the wild is a priority. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le14ob10aud10"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Your soccer team is going to Buenos Aires to play a game."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Go on the internet and see what you can do on days off in Buenos Aires. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a list of what you should bring to this city. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write an e-mail to a friend going with you on how to prepare to be safe."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your e-mail aloud to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about what to do on a trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make suggestions on what to bring on a trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask for suggestions for activities on the trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make suggestions on how to prepare for a trip."}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le14ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le14ob10re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le14ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "Sally's Suitcase</br></br>People who venture into the Grand Canyon either can't wait to hike it again, or never want to. I loved the canyon. My friend Vanessa did not. So, we're typical.", "id": 1, "time": "1", "image": "engenn4le14ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "On our first day, we started down Bright Angel Trail. We saw astonishing rock formations and heard coyotes in the distance.", "id": 2, "time": "14500", "image": "engenn4le14ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "On day two, we trekked up to a plateau. We camped and rested. We marveled at the vista! This is why everyone should bring a camera along.\n</br>On a shorter day trip, Vanessa wrenched her ankle. The rangers helped us out.", "id": 3, "time": "24000", "image": "engenn4le14ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Anyone attempting this trip should understand there are hazards. Prepare for the trip. Check online to see what seasonal gear you need. Safety is always a priority.", "id": 4, "time": "42000", "image": "engenn4le14ob10re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "text", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "Sally's Suitcase<br/><br/>\n\nPeople who venture into the Grand Canyon either can't wait to hike it again, or never want to. I loved the canyon. My friend Vanessa did not. So, we're typical.<br/><br/>\nOn our first day, we started down Bright Angel Trail. We saw astonishing rock formations and heard coyotes in the distance.\nOn day two, we trekked up to a plateau. We camped and rested. We marveled at the vista! This is why everyone should bring a camera along. <br/><br/>\nOn a shorter day trip, Vanessa wrenched her ankle. The rangers helped us out.<br/><br/>\nAnyone attempting this trip should understand there are hazards. Prepare for the trip. Check online to see what seasonal gear you need. Safety is always a priority."}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about things to do or take on a trip. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can report about things, actions and events."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can make suggestions. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "D